post.description:
General-purpose MCP telemetry ingestion endpoint.

This endpoint accepts the standard MCP telemetry format used by
any instrumented MCP server. It translates the events to DEO format
and processes them through the DEO pipeline.

Format:
```json
{
  "events": [
    {
      "eventType": "query|connection|schema_discovery|optimization",
      "eventData": {
        "tool": "tool-name",
        "action": "action-name",
        "duration_ms": 100,
        "result": "success|failure",
        "metadata": {...}
      },
      "context": {
        "sessionId": "session_xxx",
        "mcpServerId": "mcp_xxx",
        "environment": "production",
        "timestamp": "2026-02-07T..."
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

Multi-tenancy:
- If source_id is provided, org_id is resolved from DEOSource
- Otherwise, uses "default" org (useful for open-source MCP servers)

